{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q38", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主的身材外貌如何？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "分析命主外貌应从命宫、身宫、疾厄宫、迁移宫、福德宫及五行局综合推断。\n\n- **命宫**：丁酉，天相（陷）坐守，辅天钺。天相在陷地，通常主身材中等偏矮，气质温和但不算突出，天钺加持则有清秀之姿。  \n- **身宫**：财帛宫癸巳，天府（得）、火星、禄存、红鸾同宫。天府得地主稳重丰腴，禄存增其福态，火星略带火气，红鸾主容貌秀丽有吸引力，故整体体型可能偏丰满，面容和善。  \n- **迁移宫**：廉贞平、破军陷，左辅、地劫。破军陷落不主高大魁梧，地劫可能带来外貌上某些不协调。  \n- **疾厄宫**：辰宫无主星，陀罗独守，体质或外貌可能有小瑕疵如疤痕，但非重大影响。  \n- **福德宫**：紫微旺、七杀平，右弼天魁，气质带威严但七杀平不主魁梧。  \n- **五行局**：山下火，火六局，肤色不易白皙，偏黄或红润。  \n\n综合观之，命宫天相陷不主高瘦，身宫天府得、禄存、红鸾倾向微胖和悦，无高大魁梧之象，也无极度丑陋贫薄之征，故D项最吻合。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1b", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_20070131_P008-Q38", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1b_R2_P1_G4\\details_2024_b1b_R2_P1_G4.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 18739, "response_id": "b7aa81fa-4fb9-40b2-bba8-38f9ba01ccea", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 731, "completion_tokens": 998, "total_tokens": 1729, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 640}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 668}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 640, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 91}}
{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q39", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主在2016年，家中发生何事？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命盘分析，2016年（丙申年）命主虚岁10岁，大限在命宫酉。流年命宫在申，流年父母宫在酉，与命主本命宫、大限命宫重叠，象征该年家庭焦点在于父母。\n\n本命迁移宫廉贞平、破军陷，有左辅、地劫，且廉贞化忌，形成“廉贞化忌+破军陷”的凶格，主血光、意外。2016年丙申，流年天干丙使得廉贞再次化忌，与原局化忌重叠，形成双忌夹击。流年疾厄宫恰在卯（原局迁移宫），双忌力量爆发，且卯宫直冲流年父母宫酉。天相在酉虽陷但无煞，被对宫廉破双忌冲动，主父母之一突遭血光灾劫，尤以父亲（阳星廉贞）应验较高。\n\n本命父母宫戌天机化权、天梁庙，天机主四肢，化权表示刚强，天梁虽有化解之力，但流年冲击过强。综合推断，父亲遭遇严重车祸休养在家的象义最为凸显。其他选项如破产（财帛宫天府得、禄存守，不易破产）、祖母去世（福德宫紫杀旺无煞）、离异（父母宫稳定）均无明显征兆。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1b", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_20070131_P008-Q39", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1b_R2_P1_G4\\details_2024_b1b_R2_P1_G4.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 40399, "response_id": "fdafd17f-1af3-489a-b7a3-7a7df4669f1f", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 706, "completion_tokens": 2266, "total_tokens": 2972, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 640}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1957}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 640, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 66}}
